          "body": "Hi, I'm in Flat 2 directly below Flat 3. There's a brown stain on my kitchen ceiling that wasn't there at the weekend, and it's grown since yesterday - it's about the size of a dinner plate now and the paint is starting to bubble at one edge. I think water is coming from upstairs.",
